<title>UK: Co-op says not in talks with Lanica.</title>
<headline>Co-op says not in talks with Lanica.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Co-operative Wholesale Society Ltd (CWS) confirmed on Wednesday that it has not been in talks with Lanica Trust or its head Andre Regan.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that it has no plans to enter into discussions either and its main priority is to improve the level of performance across all its businesses.</p>
<p>CWS said in February that it had no plans to dispose of CWS businesses or assets to Lanica or Regan following a statement from Lanica that a company it had an investment in would approach CWS to disuss the possible purchase of non-food businesses.</p>
<p>London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
